{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/bd066e692cc2b0a87803a5460bf3724f.poster.avif?t=1755959942\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/bd066e692cc2b0a87803a5460bf3724f.webm?t=1755959942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/bd066e692cc2b0a87803a5460bf3724f.mp4?t=1755959942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/d95c9bbb3f9a1782d3c52170aeef497c.avif?t=1755959942\" data-has-big width=800 height=416 /></span><strong>Story Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you were blessed by the God of Semen and granted a powerful semen-based ability to defeat the rampant Semen Demons plaguing the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, fearing that your overwhelming power might harm women, you turned down numerous love confessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, a motorcycle-riding girl named Hinako crashes into your life\u2014literally\u2014by smashing into a convenience store. Her fierce battle against a Semen Demon rekindles your sense of purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to fight alongside her, determined to save the city. Thus begins your wild, bizarre, romantic, thrilling, and lewd everyday adventure together.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/475df3d18db9969a544cd18dc2a89af7.avif?t=1755959942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system is fast-paced and packed with impact. Players can build up &quot;Ignition Points&quot; through consecutive attacks. Once the meter is full, you'll enter the &quot;Ignition Mode,&quot; allowing you to gather semen energy and unleash a variety of powerful Semen Phantom Skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These skills can be freely equipped and combined, letting you customize your combat style and enjoy an exhilarating, nonstop, high-intensity battle experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/3d92b3a1b7b2301d63a8d3147d3e62b9.avif?t=1755959942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Love All Around the Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different places, different positions\u2014on the balcony! By the desk! On the bed! All in the name of saving the world. As your relationship with Hinako deepens, what kind of naughty fun will you explore today? Over 50 unique H scenes await your discovery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/3219488a57820d8d8671b76377b6f619.poster.avif?t=1755959942\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/3219488a57820d8d8671b76377b6f619.webm?t=1755959942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/extras/3219488a57820d8d8671b76377b6f619.mp4?t=1755959942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755370?t=1755959942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755370?t=1755959942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755370/818609009fa5aca4d1ba